@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 08. Supervisor Agent Exception Handling

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

class SupervisorA2AController
class SupervisorAgentService
class SupervisorAgentOrchestrator
class HitlDecisionService
class HandoffPolicyService
class DefaultA2AInvocationService
class A2AJsonRpcClient
class GlobalExceptionHandler
class SupervisorSwarmStateStore

class ChatProcessingException
class DownstreamA2AException
class A2ARoutingException
class HitlDecisionRequiredException
class HitlCanceledException
class HandoffValidationException
class WebClientResponseException

SupervisorA2AController --> SupervisorAgentService
SupervisorAgentService --> SupervisorAgentOrchestrator
SupervisorAgentOrchestrator --> HitlDecisionService
SupervisorAgentOrchestrator --> HandoffPolicyService
SupervisorAgentOrchestrator --> DefaultA2AInvocationService
SupervisorAgentOrchestrator --> SupervisorSwarmStateStore
DefaultA2AInvocationService --> A2AJsonRpcClient

A2AJsonRpcClient --> DownstreamA2AException : throw
DefaultA2AInvocationService --> A2ARoutingException : throw
SupervisorAgentOrchestrator --> ChatProcessingException : throw
HitlDecisionService --> HitlDecisionRequiredException : throw
HitlDecisionService --> HitlCanceledException : throw
HandoffPolicyService --> HandoffValidationException : throw

GlobalExceptionHandler --> ChatProcessingException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> DownstreamA2AException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> A2ARoutingException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> HitlDecisionRequiredException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> HitlCanceledException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> HandoffValidationException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> WebClientResponseException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> IllegalArgumentException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> IllegalStateException : @ExceptionHandler

note bottom of GlobalExceptionHandler
Return sanitized response
- /a2a/** -> JsonRpcResponse(error)
- no downstream raw payload leak
end note

